      }
    },
    "Each chart is the hottest sensor of its domain over the last five minutes, live at the refresh cycle. Click a chart to watch every sensor behind it; Details lists the raw keys." : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each chart is the hottest sensor of its domain over the last five minutes, live at the refresh cycle. Click a chart to watch every sensor behind it; Details lists the raw keys."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每张图表显示的是该区域过去五分钟内最热的传感器，按刷新周期实时更新。点击图表可查看它背后的全部传感器；「详情」列出原始键名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each line is the hottest sensor of its domain: CPU die in orange, GPU die in red. High numbers under load are normal; the Energy tab keeps the long-term thermal record and the throttling log." : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each line is the hottest sensor of its domain: CPU die in orange, GPU die in red. High numbers under load are normal; the Energy tab keeps the long-term thermal record and the throttling log."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每条线是该区域最热的传感器：CPU 芯片为橙色，GPU 芯片为红色。负载下偏高属正常；长期温度记录和降频日志在「电量」标签页。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each line is the hottest sensor of its domain: CPU die in orange, GPU die in red. Longer ranges keep the peaks, not the average, so spikes stay visible. The status follows macOS's own thermal pressure verdict, the signal that the system is actually slowing work down." : {
      "comment" : "Battery & Energy View",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each line is the hottest sensor of its domain: CPU die in orange, GPU die in red. Longer ranges keep the peaks, not the average, so spikes stay visible. The status follows macOS's own thermal pressure verdict, the signal that the system is actually slowing work down."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每条线代表该区域最热的传感器：CPU 芯片为橙色，GPU 芯片为红色。较长的时间范围保留峰值而非平均值，以保持峰值可见。状态遵循 macOS 自身的散热压力判断，即系统实际开始降频的信号。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each process's GPU share, grouped by what it is: AI and ML runtimes, display and app UI, media, and everything else. Shares can overlap on the GPU, so the bar is the split of the busy time, not of the whole device." : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each process's GPU share, grouped by what it is: AI and ML runtimes, display and app UI, media, and everything else. Shares can overlap on the GPU, so the bar is the split of the busy time, not of the whole device."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个进程的 GPU 占用，按类型分组：AI 与机器学习运行时、显示与应用界面、媒体，以及其他所有类型。GPU 上的占用可以重叠，因此这个条形图表示的是繁忙时间的分配，而不是整台设备的分配。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
