    },
    "GPU is the share of one GPU the process used over the last few seconds (the figure Activity Monitor calls % GPU); GPU ms/s is the same as milliseconds of GPU time per second. Browsers, Electron apps and Safari do their GPU work in helper processes, which appear under their own names." : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GPU is the share of one GPU the process used over the last few seconds (the figure Activity Monitor calls % GPU); GPU ms/s is the same as milliseconds of GPU time per second. Browsers, Electron apps and Safari do their GPU work in helper processes, which appear under their own names."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GPU 是该进程在过去几秒内使用的单个 GPU 的比例（即活动监视器中 % GPU 的数值）；GPU ms/s 是每秒的 GPU 时间毫秒数。浏览器、Electron 应用和 Safari 的 GPU 工作在辅助进程中完成，这些进程以各自的名称显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
