          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 为保持内存可用而工作的强度，0 到 100。点击查看详情。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How it's calculated" : {
      "comment" : "Metric Cards & Explanations",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How it's calculated"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "计算方式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the interval the GPU was powered on at all. The difference between this and utilisation is time the GPU was awake but waiting; the Device panel shows which clock states it ran in." : {
      "comment" : "Metric Cards & Explanations",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How much of the interval the GPU was powered on at all. The difference between this and utilisation is time the GPU was awake but waiting; the Device panel shows which clock states it ran in."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GPU 处于通电状态的采样间隔时间比例。该值与利用率之间的差值代表 GPU 处于清醒但处于等待状态的时间；设备面板显示了其运行的时钟状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the unified memory is currently in use by GPU clients: textures, buffers, and, for AI runtimes, the model weights. It counts against the same RAM the CPU uses." : {
      "comment" : "Metric Cards & Explanations",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How much of the unified memory is currently in use by GPU clients: textures, buffers, and, for AI runtimes, the model weights. It counts against the same RAM the CPU uses."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当前被 GPU 客户端占用的统一内存大小：包括纹理、缓冲区以及 AI 运行时的模型权重。它会占用与 CPU 相同的 RAM 空间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of this device each stack uses — e.g. your security/IT tools — to inform laptop sizing." : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How much of this device each stack uses — e.g. your security/IT tools — to inform laptop sizing."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每套软件栈（例如你的安全或 IT 工具）占这台设备多少，用来判断该配多大的机器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of your Mac's total CPU capacity is in use right now, across all cores, from 0 to 100 percent. 100 percent means every logical core is fully busy." : {
      "comment" : "Metric Cards & Explanations",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How much of your Mac's total CPU capacity is in use right now, across all cores, from 0 to 100 percent. 100 percent means every logical core is fully busy."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当前所有核心上使用的 Mac 总 CPU 容量比例，从 0 到 100 百分比。100% 意味着每个逻辑核心都处于完全繁忙状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much power the GPU block is drawing. On Apple silicon the GPU shares the chip's power budget with the CPU, so a busy GPU can throttle everything." : {
      "comment" : "Metric Cards & Explanations",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How much power the GPU block is drawing. On Apple silicon the GPU shares the chip's power budget with the CPU, so a busy GPU can throttle everything."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GPU 模块当前消耗的功率。在 Apple 芯片上，GPU 与 CPU 共享整颗芯片的功耗预算，因此繁忙的 GPU 可能会限制整体性能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How the footprint score works" : {
      "comment" : "Groups View",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How the footprint score works"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "占用得分的计算方式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How the interval split across the GPU's performance states, lowest clock first; OFF is the share it was powered down. A thermal limit or a power cap shows here before it shows as lost frames." : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How the interval split across the GPU's performance states, lowest clock first; OFF is the share it was powered down. A thermal limit or a power cap shows here before it shows as lost frames."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这段时间在 GPU 各性能状态上的分布，时钟从低到高排列；OFF 是断电所占的比例。温度限制或功耗上限会先在这里显现，然后才表现为丢帧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
