          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 需要时可自行回收的空间：缓存、优化后的原件、同步内容。它与扫描计入的文件有重叠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Space the system could make available on the boot volume, including purgeable content." : {
