    "Spare RAM that macOS is using to keep recently used files handy. This is not a problem: it is released the instant anything needs the space, so it should never be a cause for concern." : {
      "comment" : "Metric Cards & Explanations",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spare RAM that macOS is using to keep recently used files handy. This is not a problem: it is released the instant anything needs the space, so it should never be a cause for concern."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用作良性文件缓存的闲置 RAM，在需要时立即可释放。这不会造成问题：一旦有任何程序需要空间就会立即释放，因此无需担心。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spare RAM used as a benign file cache, released on demand. Click for details." : {
