    },
    "The Disk Map scans your disk to show what is using space. With Full Disk Access it can see Mail, Messages, Safari, Time Machine and other apps' data; without it those stay hidden and macOS asks about Desktop, Documents and Downloads separately. The grant takes effect after %@ relaunches." : {
      "comment" : "Disk Map (1.6.0)",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Disk Map scans your disk to show what is using space. With Full Disk Access it can see Mail, Messages, Safari, Time Machine and other apps' data; without it those stay hidden and macOS asks about Desktop, Documents and Downloads separately. The grant takes effect after %@ relaunches."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "磁盘地图通过扫描磁盘来显示空间被什么占用。拥有完全磁盘访问权限时，它可以看到邮件、信息、Safari、时间机器及其他应用的数据；没有该权限时这些内容将保持隐藏，且 macOS 会分别询问“桌面”“文稿”和“下载”的访问权限。权限在%@重新启动后生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The battery level over the selected window, 0-100%. The line's slope shows how fast it was charging or draining." : {
      "comment" : "Battery & Energy View",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The battery level over the selected window, 0-100%. The line's slope shows how fast it was charging or draining."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所选时间窗口内的电池电量，0-100%。线条斜率显示充电或耗电的速度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The busy fraction of each logical core (user plus system time over the tick, from the kernel's per-core tick counters) averaged across all cores, times 100. The split below is that same total divided into user-mode and system-mode (kernel) time." : {
      "comment" : "Metric Cards & Explanations",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The busy fraction of each logical core (user plus system time over the tick, from the kernel's per-core tick counters) averaged across all cores, times 100. The split below is that same total divided into user-mode and system-mode (kernel) time."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个逻辑核心的繁忙比例（采样间隔内的用户加系统时间，来自内核的每核心时钟滴答计数器）在所有核心上的平均值，乘以 100。下方的拆分是将该总计分为用户模式和系统模式（内核）时间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The chip's ANE energy counter (IOReport `Energy Model`) differenced between ticks." : {
      "comment" : "Metric Cards & Explanations",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The chip's ANE energy counter (IOReport `Energy Model`) differenced between ticks."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "时钟滴答之间芯片 ANE 能量计数器 (IOReport 中的“Energy Model”) 的差值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The chip's GPU energy counter (IOReport `Energy Model`, the source powermetrics uses) differenced between ticks and divided by the elapsed time." : {
      "comment" : "Metric Cards & Explanations",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The chip's GPU energy counter (IOReport `Energy Model`, the source powermetrics uses) differenced between ticks and divided by the elapsed time."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "芯片的 GPU 能量计数器（IOReport 中的“Energy Model”，也是 powermetrics 工具使用的数据源）在时钟滴答之间的差值除以经过的时间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The colour band comes from the kernel's memory-pressure level. Within that band the exact position is set by how loaded memory is: 50 percent from compression (compressed memory over RAM, full at half your RAM), 30 percent from swap (swap over RAM, full at one times your RAM), and 20 percent from how fast compressed plus swap is rising. The value is the band floor plus that signal times 33." : {
      "comment" : "Metric Cards & Explanations",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The colour band comes from the kernel's memory-pressure level. Within that band the exact position is set by how loaded memory is: 50 percent from compression (compressed memory over RAM, full at half your RAM), 30 percent from swap (swap over RAM, full at one times your RAM), and 20 percent from how fast compressed plus swap is rising. The value is the band floor plus that signal times 33."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "颜色区间来自内核的内存压力级别。在对应区间内，具体数值由内存负载程度决定：50% 来自压缩（压缩内存占 RAM 的比例，在达到 RAM 一半时满格），30% 来自交换（交换空间占 RAM 的比例，在达到 RAM 1 倍时满格），20% 来自压缩加交换的上升速度。最终数值为区间底值加上该信号乘 33。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The compressor's page count times the page size: compressed = compressor page count times page size, read from the kernel's VM statistics." : {
      "comment" : "Metric Cards & Explanations",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The compressor's page count times the page size: compressed = compressor page count times page size, read from the kernel's VM statistics."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "压缩器的页面计数乘以页面大小：被压缩 = 压缩器页面计数乘以页面大小，从内核的 VM 统计信息中读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The core of macOS itself. It also deliberately uses CPU to keep the Mac cool: so high CPU here often means the system is managing heat, not a problem you can fix by quitting it." : {
      "comment" : "Metric Cards & Explanations",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The core of macOS itself. It also deliberately uses CPU to keep the Mac cool: so high CPU here often means the system is managing heat, not a problem you can fix by quitting it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 系统的核心本身。它还会通过调度 CPU 运转来协助散热：因此此处 CPU 偏高通常表明系统正在进行散热管理，而非程序故障。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The discovery socket could not be opened." : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The discovery socket could not be opened."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法打开发现套接字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first address must not come after the last address." : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The first address must not come after the last address."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "起始地址不能晚于结束地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first process macOS starts (PID 1). It launches and supervises every other service and app. Essential: never quit it." : {
      "comment" : "Metric Cards & Explanations",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The first process macOS starts (PID 1). It launches and supervises every other service and app. Essential: never quit it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 启动的首个进程 (PID 1)。负责启动并监管所有其他服务和应用。系统核心组件：切勿退出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The hottest CPU die sensor. The colour follows macOS's thermal pressure: green means hot but working as designed. Click for details." : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The hottest CPU die sensor. The colour follows macOS's thermal pressure: green means hot but working as designed. Click for details."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最热的 CPU 芯片传感器。颜色跟随 macOS 的散热压力：绿色表示发热但仍在设计范围内。点击查看详情。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The hottest of the CPU die's temperature sensors, the figure people mean by \\u{201C}CPU temperature\\u{201D}. High numbers under load are normal on Apple silicon; the colour turns orange or red only when macOS itself reports thermal pressure, the signal that it is slowing work down." : {
      "comment" : "Metric Cards & Explanations",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The hottest of the CPU die's temperature sensors, the figure people mean by \\u{201C}CPU temperature\\u{201D}. High numbers under load are normal on Apple silicon; the colour turns orange or red only when macOS itself reports thermal pressure, the signal that it is slowing work down."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CPU 芯片上最热的温度传感器，也就是大家通常所说的“CPU 温度”。Apple 芯片在高负载下出现较高数值属正常现象；只有当 macOS 自身报告散热压力（即系统正在降频的信号）时，颜色才会变为橙色或红色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The hottest of the CPU die's temperature sensors, the figure people mean by “CPU temperature”. High numbers under load are normal on Apple silicon; the colour turns orange or red only when macOS itself reports thermal pressure, the signal that it is slowing work down." : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The hottest of the CPU die's temperature sensors, the figure people mean by “CPU temperature”. High numbers under load are normal on Apple silicon; the colour turns orange or red only when macOS itself reports thermal pressure, the signal that it is slowing work down."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CPU 芯片上最热的那个温度传感器，也就是大家平时说的「CPU 温度」。在 Apple 芯片上，负载高时数字偏高是正常的；只有当 macOS 自己报告存在温度压力，也就是它开始放慢工作时，颜色才会变成橙色或红色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The last 2 hours of memory pressure, with each spike marked." : {
      "comment" : "InsightsView",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The last 2 hours of memory pressure, with each spike marked."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最近 2 小时的内存压力,每次峰值均已标记。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The main thread is blocked in {sample.mainFunction}, not its run loop — the app is frozen." : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The main thread is blocked in {sample.mainFunction}, not its run loop — the app is frozen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主线程阻塞在 {sample.mainFunction}，而不是在它的 run loop 上，应用已经卡死。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The main thread is servicing its run loop — responsive." : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The main thread is servicing its run loop — responsive."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主线程正在处理它的 run loop，响应正常。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The network menu measures latency and jitter by pinging this host while the menu is open." : {
      "comment" : "SettingsView",
