    "The share of each interval the GPU spent executing work, from the graphics driver's own device utilisation counter. It is the same figure Activity Monitor's GPU History shows." : {
      "comment" : "Metric Cards & Explanations",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The share of each interval the GPU spent executing work, from the graphics driver's own device utilisation counter. It is the same figure Activity Monitor's GPU History shows."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GPU 在每个采样间隔内执行工作的时间比例，来自图形驱动程序自身的设备利用率计数器。这与活动监视器的 GPU 历史记录中显示的数值相同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The space is freed when you empty the Trash in Finder, and you can put the item back until then." : {
