    "Total CPU has averaged %1$@%% over the last %2$@ min. Sustained high CPU is normal during real work, but it warms the machine and drains battery — the top CPU process is the place to look." : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Total CPU has averaged %1$@%% over the last %2$@ min. Sustained high CPU is normal during real work, but it warms the machine and drains battery — the top CPU process is the place to look."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "过去 %2$@ 分钟内 CPU 平均占用 %1$@%%。持续高 CPU 占用在真正干活时是正常的，但会让机器发热、耗电，先看看占用最高的进程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Total CPU has stayed above %@%% for a sustained period. If this is unexpected, the top CPU process is the place to look." : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Total CPU has stayed above %@%% for a sustained period. If this is unexpected, the top CPU process is the place to look."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CPU 总占用已持续高于 %@%%。如果这不在预期内，先看占用最高的那个进程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Total CPU is the share of all cores in use, 0-100%. Per-process CPU (in the list and menubar) follows Activity Monitor: percent of one core, so a busy multi-threaded app can exceed 100%." : {
      "comment" : "DashboardView",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Total CPU is the share of all cores in use, 0-100%. Per-process CPU (in the list and menubar) follows Activity Monitor: percent of one core, so a busy multi-threaded app can exceed 100%."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "总 CPU 是所有核心的使用比例,范围 0-100%。按进程统计的 CPU(在列表和菜单栏中)与活动监视器一致,按单个核心的百分比计算,因此繁忙的多线程应用可能超过 100%。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
